# ProjectBrain Charter

## Vision

A personal project intelligence system that learns across repositories and serves context to AI agents.

## Goals

- Track decisions and outcomes across projects
- Identify patterns in success, failure, and abandonment
- Integrate natively with Cursor and Claude Code

## Success Criteria

- Sub-100ms context retrieval for active projects
- Automatic charter and git ingestion
- Cross-project pattern surfacing by M3
